doctype html
html(lang='en')
  head
    meta(charset='utf-8')
    meta(name='viewport', content='width=device-width, initial-scale=1')
    title Cat tracker
    link(rel='stylesheet', href='/style.css')
  body
    h1 Cat tracker
    p Generated at #{ generated }. Refresh this page for updated data.
    .table
      table
        thead
          tr
            th Tag
            th Status
            th Last seen
            th Average RSSI · 5 min
            th Alert sent
        tbody
          each tag in tags
            tr
              th(scope='row')
                = tag.name
                small= tag.id
              td= tag.status
              td= tag.lastSeen
              td= tag.average
              td= tag.alertSent
    p.
      RSSI averages use observations since service startup, up to five minutes. — means no recent
      observations. Alert sent means Telegram confirmed the absence notification for the current
      episode.
